ssroom.","example_zh":"高處窗戶改善教室通風。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ventilation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-verification-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"verification","sort_order":1,"sense":"驗證","alt_zh":"成年檔案員仔細比較老照片、日曆檔案與紀錄，文字不可辨識。","example":"The archivist completed the verification of the photograph's date.","example_zh":"檔案員完成照片日期的驗證。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/verification-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-versatility-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"versatility","sort_order":1,"sense":"多才多藝","alt_zh":"成年女音樂家坐在音樂教室鋼琴旁，身邊擺著小提琴與長笛，高中生讚賞聆聽。","example":"The musician's versatility allowed her to play several instruments.","example_zh":"那位音樂家多才多藝，能演奏數種樂器。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/versatility-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-veto-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"veto","sort_order":1,"sense":"否決","alt_zh":"公民教室虛構政治制度模型中，成年總統把法案退回議會代表，無真實政治人物或文字。","example":"The president used a veto to block the proposed law.","example_zh":"總統行使否決權，阻止法案通過。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/veto-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vigilance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vigilance","sort_order":1,"sense":"警覺","alt_zh":"成年救生員在泳池高椅上專注觀察穿合宜泳裝的泳客，無危急情況。","example":"The lifeguard's vigilance helped keep swimmers safe.","example_zh":"救生員的警覺有助維護游泳者安全。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vigilance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vindication-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vindication","sort_order":1,"sense":"平反","alt_zh":"成年工作人員在辦公室看到證明自己清白的紀錄，主管誠懇握手道歉。","example":"The new evidence brought vindication for the wrongly accused worker.","example_zh":"新證據讓遭錯誤指控的員工獲得平反。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vindication-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-violation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"violation","sort_order":1,"sense":"違反","alt_zh":"成年管理員指出堵住建築緊急出口的自行車，車主準備牽走，無文字。","example":"Parking in front of the emergency exit was a violation of the rules.","example_zh":"在緊急出口前停車違反規定。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/violation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-virtue-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"virtue","sort_order":1,"sense":"美德","alt_zh":"高中女生耐心陪同學重新組裝模型，老師在旁欣慰微笑。","example":"Her patience was a virtue that helped the whole team learn.","example_zh":"她的耐心是幫助全隊學習的美德。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/virtue-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-visualization-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"visualization","sort_order":1,"sense":"視覺化","alt_zh":"高中生觀察立體流域教具，藍色細流從山坡匯入主河，無文字。","example":"The visualization made the river's flow easier to understand.","example_zh":"視覺化呈現讓河水流向更容易理解。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/visualization-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vocation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vocation","sort_order":1,"sense":"職業；志業","alt_zh":"成年女教師在溫暖教室耐心指導高中生，桌上有書本與模型。","example":"Teaching became her vocation after years of helping younger students.","example_zh":"多年協助年幼學生後，教學成了她的志業。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vocation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-volatility-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"volatility","sort_order":1,"sense":"波動性","alt_zh":"成年老師向高中生展示無數字、起伏明顯的金融教學圖表，無投資建議。","example":"The lesson used a changing graph to illustrate market volatility.","example_zh":"課程用變動圖表說明市場波動性。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/volatility-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-vulnerability-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"vulnerability","sort_order":1,"sense":"脆弱性","alt_zh":"成年建築師從安全地面查看風暴後受損的空屋屋頂，無傷者。","example":"The storm revealed the vulnerability of the old roof.","example_zh":"風暴顯露老屋頂的脆弱性。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/vulnerability-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-warehouse-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"warehouse","sort_order":1,"sense":"倉庫","alt_zh":"成年倉儲人員在寬敞整齊的倉庫查看分類書箱，通道清楚暢通。","example":"The warehouse stored books before they were sent to schools.","example_zh":"倉庫存放準備送往學校的書籍。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/warehouse-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-watershed-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"watershed","sort_order":1,"sense":"集水區；分水嶺","alt_zh":"高中生觀察單一立體山谷集水區模型，多條藍色支流匯入主河出口，山脊界線清楚。","example":"The model showed how streams within a watershed drain toward the same river.","example_zh":"模型展示集水區內的溪流如何匯向同一條河。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/watershed-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-wavelength-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"wavelength","sort_order":1,"sense":"波長","alt_zh":"老師在高中教室展示繩波靜態模型，用量尺指示相鄰兩個波峰的水平距離