lic/word-illustrations/senior/yearning-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-zenith-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"zenith","sort_order":1,"sense":"頂點；天頂","alt_zh":"白晝安靜庭院，太陽接近正上方，立柱投下短影，高中生待在陰涼處。","example":"The sun approached its zenith above the quiet courtyard.","example_zh":"太陽逐漸接近寧靜庭院上空的天頂。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/zenith-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-zoology-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"zoology","sort_order":1,"sense":"動物學","alt_zh":"老師在高中教室展示數種鳥類翅膀教學模型，無受傷動物。","example":"The zoology lesson compared the structures of different bird wings.","example_zh":"動物學課比較不同鳥類翅膀的構造。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/zoology-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-abbreviation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"abbreviation","sort_order":1,"sense":"縮寫","alt_zh":"高中生在教室指著文章中短小詞組，老師耐心解說，文字不可辨識。","example":"The teacher explained an abbreviation in the science article.","example_zh":"老師解釋科學文章中的一個縮寫。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/abbreviation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-abdomen-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"abdomen","sort_order":1,"sense":"腹部","alt_zh":"老師向高中生展示完整衣著人體輪廓教具與腹部內臟的非血腥教學模型。","example":"The model showed the organs located in the abdomen.","example_zh":"模型展示位於腹部的器官。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/abdomen-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-abolition-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"abolition","sort_order":1,"sense":"廢除","alt_zh":"高中生在歷史博物館觀看自由題材畫作與打開的舊枷鎖文物，無人被束縛。","example":"The exhibit explored the movement for the abolition of slavery.","example_zh":"展覽探討廢除奴隸制度的運動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/abolition-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-abortion-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"abortion","sort_order":1,"sense":"墮胎","alt_zh":"成年醫師在大學公共衛生講座與成年學生進行中立尊重的討論，無醫療處置或胎兒畫面。","example":"The public-health lecture discussed abortion with care and respect.","example_zh":"公共衛生講座謹慎而尊重地討論墮胎議題。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/abortion-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-abound-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"abound","sort_order":1,"sense":"充斥；大量存在","alt_zh":"高中健行隊沿安全小徑欣賞春季草甸大量盛開的野花。","example":"Wildflowers abound in the meadow during spring.","example_zh":"春天的草地上開滿野花。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/abound-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-absentee-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"absentee","sort_order":1,"sense":"缺席者","alt_zh":"高中教室裡一張空座位桌上留著整齊筆記，老師向同學示意替缺席同學保管。","example":"The teacher left a copy of the notes for the absentee.","example_zh":"老師為缺席者留下一份筆記。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/absentee-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-absorption-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"absorption","sort_order":1,"sense":"吸收","alt_zh":"高中生在老師指導下觀察海綿吸水並用天平比較重量。","example":"The sponge's absorption of water made it noticeably heavier.","example_zh":"海綿吸水後明顯變重。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/absorption-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-abstinence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"abstinence","sort_order"