1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/acquaintance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-activism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"activism","sort_order":1,"sense":"行動主義","alt_zh":"高中女生帶領同學設置回收與重複使用水壺攤位，無文字標語。","example":"Her environmental activism encouraged the school to reduce plastic waste.","example_zh":"她的環保行動鼓勵學校減少塑膠垃圾。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/activism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-acupuncture-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"acupuncture","sort_order":1,"sense":"針灸","alt_zh":"高中訪客在醫療文化博物館觀看封閉展櫃中的歷史針灸器具與示意模型，無刺針操作。","example":"The museum explained the history of acupuncture.","example_zh":"博物館介紹針灸的歷史。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/acupuncture-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-adamant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"adamant","sort_order":1,"sense":"堅定的","alt_zh":"高中女生在小組活動中堅定而友善地邀安靜同學輪流操作模型，其他人聆聽。","example":"She was adamant that every team member should have a turn.","example_zh":"她堅持每位隊員都應輪到一次。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/adamant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-adaptation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"adaptation","sort_order":1,"sense":"改編","alt_zh":"高中劇團在舞臺排練冒險故事，成年導演桌上並排小說與劇本，無可讀文字。","example":"The school play was an adaptation of a classic adventure novel.","example_zh":"學校戲劇改編自經典冒險小說。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/adaptation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-additive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"additive","sort_order":1,"sense":"添加劑","alt_zh":"成年材料研究員在安全實驗室比較密封顏料樣本與少量添加材料，無配方。","example":"T